README.md
    1→# MCPHost 🤖
    3→A CLI host application that enables Large Language Models (LLMs) to interact with external tools through the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Currently supports Claude, OpenAI, Google Gemini, and Ollama models.
    5→Discuss the Project on [Discord](https://discord.gg/RqSS2NQVsY)
    124→## Installation 📦
    126→```bash
    127→go install github.com/mark3labs/mcphost@latest
    128→```
    967→## MCP Server Compatibility 🔌
    969→MCPHost can work with any MCP-compliant server. For examples and reference implementations, see the [MCP Servers Repository](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers).
    981→## License 📄
    983→This project is licensed under the MIT License - see the [LICENSE](LICENSE) file for details.
